---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Cookie Policy - Varaha">
  <nav class="border-b border-white/10 glass backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex h-16 items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-8">
          <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 relative">
            <img src="/mandala2.svg" alt="Varaha Logo" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain scale-110 opacity-40 animate-spin animate-duration-1000" style="filter: brightness(0) invert(1) sepia(1) saturate(2) hue-rotate(15deg) brightness(1.2);" />
            <span class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white tracking-widest transform -translate-x-5">varaha<span class="text-brand-purple">.ai</span></span>
          </a>
          <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-6">
            <a href="/docs" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Docs</a>
            <a href="/pricing" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Pricing</a>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300">Last updated: April 5, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-8 space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device (computer, tablet, or mobile) 
              when you visit our website. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently 
              and to provide information to website owners.
            </p>
            <p>
              This policy explains how Varaha uses cookies and similar technologies to recognize you when 
              you visit our website, remember your preferences, and provide you with a personalized experience.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>2.1 Essential Cookies:</strong> These cookies are necessary for the website to function properly.</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Authentication:</strong> Keep you logged in and remember your preferences</li>
              <li><strong>Security:</strong> Help protect against fraud and unauthorized access</li>
              <li><strong>Session Management:</strong> Maintain your session across page requests</li>
              <li><strong>Load Balancing:</strong> Distribute website traffic evenly</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>2.2 Performance Cookies:</strong> These cookies help us understand how our website performs.</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Measure website traffic and user behavior</li>
              <li><strong>Error Tracking:</strong> Identify and fix website errors</li>
              <li><strong>Performance Monitoring:</strong> Optimize website speed and reliability</li>
              <li><strong>A/B Testing:</strong> Test different versions of features</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>2.3 Functional Cookies:</strong> These cookies enhance your experience and remember your choices.</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> Remember your settings and customizations</li>
              <li><strong>Language:</strong> Store your language preference</li>
              <li><strong>Theme:</strong> Remember your visual preferences</li>
              <li><strong>Features:</strong> Remember which features you've used</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>2.4 Marketing Cookies:</strong> These cookies are used to deliver relevant advertising and content.</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Advertising:</strong> Show ads relevant to your interests</li>
              <li><strong>Retargeting:</strong> Show ads based on your previous visits</li>
              <li><strong>Social Media:</strong> Enable social media sharing and integration</li>
              <li><strong>Affiliate Tracking:</strong> Track referrals and partnerships</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10 mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Session Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Temporary cookies that expire when you close your browser.</p>
              <p><strong>Examples:</strong> Login status, shopping cart contents, security tokens.</p>
              <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Session length (typically 24 hours or less).</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10 mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Persistent Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Cookies that remain on your device for a set period.</p>
              <p><strong>Examples:</strong> User preferences, login status, analytics identifiers.</p>
              <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Varies from days to years depending on purpose.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10 mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Third-Party Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Cookies set by external services we use.</p>
              <p><strong>Examples:</strong> Google Analytics, payment processors, social media platforms.</p>
              <p><strong>Control:</strong> Governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Security Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> Help protect against fraud and unauthorized access.</p>
              <p><strong>Examples:</strong> CSRF tokens, authentication verification, device fingerprinting.</p>
              <p><strong>Essential:</strong> Cannot be disabled without affecting core functionality.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">4. Managing Your Cookie Preferences</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>4.1 Cookie Consent:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>First-time visitors see a cookie consent banner</li>
              <li>Granular consent for different cookie categories</li>
              <li>Easy withdrawal of consent at any time</li>
              <li>Clear information about cookie purposes</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>4.2 Browser Controls:</strong> You can manage cookies through your browser settings:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Chrome:</strong> Settings → Privacy and security → Cookies</li>
              <li><strong>Firefox:</strong> Options → Privacy & Security → Cookies</li>
              <li><strong>Safari:</strong> Preferences → Privacy → Cookies</li>
              <li><strong>Edge:</strong> Settings → Privacy, search, and services → Cookies</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>4.3 Cookie Settings Dashboard:</strong> We provide a dedicated interface to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>View all cookies currently in use</li>
              <li>Understand the purpose of each cookie</li>
              <li>Enable/disable specific cookie categories</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent for non-essential cookies</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">5. Third-Party Services and Cookies</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>5.1 Analytics Services:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> Website traffic analysis and user behavior</li>
              <li><strong>Hotjar:</strong> User session recordings and heatmaps</li>
              <li><strong>Crazy Egg:</strong> A/B testing and conversion optimization</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>5.2 Payment Processors:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Stripe:</strong> Payment processing and fraud detection</li>
              <li><strong>PayPal:</strong> Alternative payment processing</li>
              <li><strong>Braintree:</strong> Additional payment options</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>5.3 Social Media Integration:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Twitter/X:</strong> Social sharing and authentication</li>
              <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> Professional networking integration</li>
              <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> Developer authentication and integration</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>5.4 Control:</strong> Third-party cookies are governed by their respective privacy policies.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">6. Cookie Lifespan and Renewal</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10 mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Session Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Expire when browser session ends</p>
              <p><strong>Renewal:</strong> New cookie created on each visit</p>
              <p><strong>Storage:</strong> Stored in browser memory only</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10 mb-4">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Persistent Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Set expiration dates (days to years)</p>
              <p><strong>Renewal:</strong> Extended on each website interaction</p>
              <p><strong>Storage:</strong> Stored on device hard drive</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Authentication Cookies</h3>
              <p><strong>Duration:</strong> Typically 30 days for "Remember Me"</p>
              <p><strong>Renewal:</strong> Extended with each login</p>
              <p><strong>Security:</strong> Encrypted and HttpOnly where possible</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">7. Your Rights Regarding Cookies</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>7.1 Right to Information:</strong> You have the right to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Know which cookies we use and why</li>
              <li>Understand the purpose of each cookie</li>
              <li>Access our cookie policy at any time</li>
              <li>Receive updates about cookie changes</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>7.2 Right to Control:</strong> You can:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Accept or reject non-essential cookies</li>
              <li>Delete existing cookies from your device</li>
              <li>Configure browser to block cookies</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>7.3 Right to Object:</strong> You can object to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Certain types of cookies (e.g., tracking)</li>
              <li>Data collection for marketing purposes</li>
              <li>Cross-site tracking mechanisms</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">8. Impact of Disabling Cookies</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>8.1 Essential Cookies:</strong> Disabling essential cookies will:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Prevent you from logging in</li>
              <li>Break shopping cart functionality</li>
              <li>Remove security protections</li>
              <li>Degrade overall website performance</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>8.2 Non-Essential Cookies:</strong> Disabling these cookies will:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Remove personalization features</li>
              <li>Prevent usage analytics collection</li>
              <li>Disable targeted advertising</li>
              <li>Reduce website optimization capabilities</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>8.3 Alternative Experience:</strong> With cookies disabled, you may experience:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Need to log in more frequently</li>
              <li>See generic instead of personalized content</li>
              <li>Receive less relevant advertisements</li>
              <li>Have reduced website functionality</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">9. Updates to This Policy</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>9.1 Policy Changes:</strong> We may update this cookie policy to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Reflect changes in our cookie practices</li>
              <li>Comply with new legal requirements</li>
              <li>Improve transparency and user control</li>
              <li>Add new cookie types or purposes</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>9.2 Notification Methods:</strong> Changes will be communicated via:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Website banners for significant changes</li>
              <li>Email notifications to registered users</li>
              <li>Updated cookie consent banners</li>
              <li>Dashboard announcements</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>9.3 Continued Use:</strong> Continued use of our website after changes 
            constitutes acceptance of the updated cookie policy.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">10. Contact and Support</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>10.1 Cookie Questions:</strong> For questions about our cookie policy:</p>
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <p>Email: privacy@varaha.ai</p>
              <p>Response Time: Within 7 business days</p>
              <p>Subject: Cookie Policy Inquiry</p>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>10.2 Technical Support:</strong> For help managing your cookie preferences:</p>
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <p>Help Center: https://varaha.ai/help</p>
              <p>Live Chat: Available on website</p>
              <p>Documentation: https://varaha.ai/docs</p>
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>10.3 Data Protection:</strong> For GDPR-related requests:</p>
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <p>DPO: dpo@varaha.ai</p>
              <p>Response Time: Within 30 days (EU requests)</p>
              <p>Rights Portal: https://varaha.ai/privacy-rights</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 text-center">
        <a href="/terms" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors mr-6">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors mr-6">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/dpa" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors">Data Processing Agreement</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
